name":"Ghagrizg Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Ghegrudh Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Aymsebellean Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Brogmorb Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Gerkrilan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker21","name":"Ananillarinan Waterfall","legend":"A breathtaking waterfall cuts through the landscape."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Sylwendell Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Brur War. \r\nDate: June 14, 3591 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Tonkhan Uur Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Olzazur Rebellion. \r\nDate: November 20, 3618 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Umneshana Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Mub Crusade. \r\nDate: November 5, 3579 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Rrigeness Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Akes-Zagisian War. \r\nDate: January 21, 2721 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Drogrod Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Qidan War. \r\nDate: February 28, 3619 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker27","name":"Skal'ar't Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Srusan Campaign. \r\nDate: March 28, 3588 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker28","name":"Chizhikas Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Lyl-Did Campaign. \r\nDate: December 25, 3661 Wigmoke Era."},{"id":"marker29","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7987930127183\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7987930127183\" san